    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/extras/90bea92089c499d346126b2d86c4c587.avif?t=1520491283\" /></div><br><br>Quadra features fast-paced, addicting gameplay that tests your dexterity and challenges you to think spatially.<br><br>Rotate the game board to quickly and strategically place colored blocks as they spawn. Match 3 colors to clear them and gain points -- if a block stack reaches the center, you lose!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lightning-fast gameplay<br></li><li>Meet all kinds of adorable blocks<br></li><li>Unlock powerful new super block types<br></li><li>Place blocks just right to unleash huge combos<br></li><li>Rank up to gold and beyond on every level<br></li><li>Play on the go! Coming to iOS</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746590/extras/422b3123551e58ddbae4cf67f07a0aad.avif?t=1520491283\" /></div><br>Visit our website (use the link in the sidebar) or find Quadra on Itch to try the free demo before buying!<br><br>This game contains flashing imagery. Please be cautious if you have a history of photosensitive seizures.",
